{"h":"<p>还在用姿态洗图？KREA2完美图生图方案，堪比1比1复刻，千问+KREA2完美搭配</p><p>和姿态参考相比，它的优势是对提示词不敏感，反而越详细越好，甚至可以不写提示词。</p><p>并且可以可以编辑原图，通过修改KREA2提示词增加画面细节。</p><p>工作流参考B站UP的教程：<a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1xvK56TEye\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1xvK56TEye</a></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/0e3f7ab7-1a54-4322-8efd-b0985bade9a3/original=true/0e3f7ab7-1a54-4322-8efd-b0985bade9a3.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/634e7654-08c5-4f28-b5e2-ca4dc09dcf11/original=true/634e7654-08c5-4f28-b5e2-ca4dc09dcf11.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/ee969c33-cb75-4661-8bfd-7f015240514e/original=true/ee969c33-cb75-4661-8bfd-7f015240514e.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/95551dc9-a3b9-4920-9d9c-24e57a694a27/original=true/95551dc9-a3b9-4920-9d9c-24e57a694a27.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/e2d39ca1-e3e2-49de-9b9e-4d63511a34ad/original=true/e2d39ca1-e3e2-49de-9b9e-4d63511a34ad.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/9c5d0457-b9b2-4174-9596-d727969ec8fe/original=true/9c5d0457-b9b2-4174-9596-d727969ec8fe.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/a6ac02c6-fe77-409e-aab1-edd5d7950d4f/original=true/a6ac02c6-fe77-409e-aab1-edd5d7950d4f.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>","lang":"zh","v":2,"o":{"zh":"<p>还在用姿态洗图？KREA2完美图生图方案，堪比1比1复刻，千问+KREA2完美搭配</p><p>和姿态参考相比，它的优势是对提示词不敏感，反而越详细越好，甚至可以不写提示词。</p><p>并且可以可以编辑原图，通过修改KREA2提示词增加画面细节。</p><p>工作流参考B站UP的教程：<a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1xvK56TEye\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1xvK56TEye</a></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/0e3f7ab7-1a54-4322-8efd-b0985bade9a3/origin